<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
  AI Vision — Over/Under
  ======================

  An Over/Under bot that prices the market itself and walks through the ten
  volatility indices while it does it. The tick block reads the market once per
  tick, and the trade options and the purchase conditions all read that same
  decision, so the barrier, the stake and the entry can never come from
  different moments. Every tick it:

    0. decides where to stand. The market block keeps the bot on the market it
       scores best and moves it on when the score drops, taking the new market's
       tick history and payout table with it. It will not leave a market whose
       history has not even arrived yet, because a switch trades a warm history
       for a cold one;
    1. forecasts the ten last digits at the moment the contract expires, with
       seven models (long-run and recent digit frequency, the digit transition
       table, a kernel replay of similar states, an analytical price forecast, a
       fair-odds anchor and an online-trained neural net);
    2. prices every barrier against the payout table it read from Deriv, or the
       conservative modelled table while the live one is in flight — the bot
       never waits on twenty proposals to make a two-second decision;
    3. picks the barrier and the side with the best expected value, and sizes the
       stake by how strong that lean is and how much the models agree;
    4. buys it. The entry bars ship OFF, so it buys the best contract it can
       price on every tick. When no barrier leans past the fair odds it still
       trades — it takes the safest contract (the widest Over or Under, where
       nine or eight digits win) and says "forced" in the journal rather than
       sitting the tick out. A bot that analyses every tick and then refuses to
       buy is the one thing this strategy must not be;
    5. paces itself: one position at most every "ai entry gap" seconds (2 by
       default). Each contract settles on the next tick, so on a two-second
       market that is one position per tick and never more;
    6. learns from the settled digit: every contract scores each model and takes
       one gradient step, per market, and the brain survives restarts.

  Set the knobs in the "Run once at start" block. Open the journal to watch the
  reasoning: every entry prints the market, the contract, the measured lean in
  points and standard deviations, the payout, the expected value and the
  confidence, plus "forced" when the AI had no lean to work with.

  If it ever looks idle, the journal says why: "warming up — 3/12 ticks on this
  market" means the tick stream has not filled yet; a plan line without an entry
  means the guard above it (loss limit, profit target or entry gap) is holding.

  Read this before running it for real
  The entry bars are OFF. "ai min lean" is 0, which means the bot buys the best
  contract it can price on every tick, whether or not that contract leans past
  the fair odds. That is what makes it trade instead of waiting; it does not
  make it right. Digit contracts carry an exchange margin, so the expected value
  printed in the journal on each entry is usually negative, and a bot that fires
  this often will reach the loss limit quickly on a market that is not paying.

  Raise "ai min lean" back to 1.5 or more to put the significance bar on — the
  forced entries stop with it — and watch the trade rate collapse. That collapse
  is the honest measure of how much of what this bot does is signal and how much
  is noise.

  Start on a demo account, keep "ai base stake" small, set "ai loss limit" to
  what you are willing to lose in a session, and never raise the stake to chase
  a loss.

  Tuning, all of it in the "Run once at start" block:

    ai base stake       0.35   the stake the AI scales up and down
    ai duration         1      ticks per contract (1 = settle on the next tick)
    ai min lean         0      sigma the lean must clear. 0 = no bar, always trade
    ai min confidence   0      0-100 quality floor. 0 = no floor
    ai agreement        0      share of models that must agree. 0 = no floor
    ai entry gap        2      seconds between positions. 0 = no limit
    ai market dwell     15     seconds to stay on a market before moving on
    ai market floor     20     with the "most suitable" mode, the score below
                               which the bot leaves a market
    ai loss limit       30     stop the bot after this much loss
    ai profit target    50     stop the bot after this much profit

  The market block is set to "the most suitable market". Change its dropdown to
  "the next market in turn" to walk the ten markets, or "any market at random".
-->
<xml xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" collection="false" is_dbot="true">
  <variables>
    <variable type="" id="aiVar01">ai base stake</variable>
    <variable type="" id="aiVar02">ai duration</variable>
    <variable type="" id="aiVar03">ai min edge</variable>
    <variable type="" id="aiVar04">ai min lean</variable>
    <variable type="" id="aiVar05">ai min confidence</variable>
    <variable type="" id="aiVar06">ai agreement</variable>
    <variable type="" id="aiVar07">ai risk</variable>
    <variable type="" id="aiVar08">ai loss limit</variable>
    <variable type="" id="aiVar09">ai profit target</variable>
    <variable type="" id="aiVar11">ai stake percent</variable>
    <variable type="" id="aiVar12">ai contracts</variable>
    <variable type="" id="aiVar13">ai market dwell</variable>
    <variable type="" id="aiVar14">ai market floor</variable>
    <variable type="" id="aiVar15">ai entry gap</variable>
  </variables>
  <block type="trade_definition" id="aiTrade01" x="0" y="0">
    <statement name="TRADE_OPTIONS">
      <block type="trade_definition_market" id="aiMarket01" deletable="false" movable="false">
        <field name="MARKET_LIST">volidx</field>
        <field name="SUBMARKET_LIST">random_index</field>
        <field name="SYMBOL_LIST">R_100</field>
        <next>
          <block type="trade_definition_tradetype" id="aiType01" deletable="false" movable="false">
            <field name="TRADETYPECAT_LIST">digits</field>
            <field name="TRADETYPE_LIST">overunder</field>
            <next>
              <block type="trade_definition_contracttype" id="aiContract01" deletable="false" movable="false">
                <field name="TYPE_LIST">both</field>
                <next>
                  <block type="trade_definition_candleinterval" id="aiCandle01" deletable="false" movable="false">
                    <field name="CANDLEINTERVAL_LIST">60</field>
                    <next>
                      <block type="trade_definition_restartbuysell" id="aiRestart01" deletable="false" movable="false">
                        <field name="TIME_MACHINE_ENABLED">FALSE</field>
                        <next>
                          <block type="trade_definition_restartonerror" id="aiError01" deletable="false" movable="false">
                            <field name="RESTARTONERROR">TRUE</field>
                          </block>
                        </next>
                      </block>
                    </next>
                  </block>
                </next>
              </block>
            </next>
          </block>
        </next>
      </block>
    </statement>
    <statement name="INITIALIZATION">
      <block type="variables_set" id="is01"><field name="VAR" id="aiVar01">ai base stake</field><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="in01"><field name="NUM">0.35</field></shadow></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="is02"><field name="VAR" id="aiVar02">ai duration</field><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="in02"><field name="NUM">1</field></shadow></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="is03"><field name="VAR" id="aiVar03">ai min edge</field><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="in03"><field name="NUM">-100</field></shadow></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="is04"><field name="VAR" id="aiVar04">ai min lean</field><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="in04"><field name="NUM">0</field></shadow></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="is05"><field name="VAR" id="aiVar05">ai min confidence</field><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="in05"><field name="NUM">0</field></shadow></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="is06"><field name="VAR" id="aiVar06">ai agreement</field><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="in06"><field name="NUM">0</field></shadow></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="is07"><field name="VAR" id="aiVar07">ai risk</field><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="in07"><field name="NUM">0.6</field></shadow></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="is08"><field name="VAR" id="aiVar08">ai loss limit</field><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="in08"><field name="NUM">30</field></shadow></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="is09"><field name="VAR" id="aiVar09">ai profit target</field><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="in09"><field name="NUM">50</field></shadow></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="is11"><field name="VAR" id="aiVar11">ai stake percent</field><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="in11"><field name="NUM">1</field></shadow></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="is12"><field name="VAR" id="aiVar12">ai contracts</field><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="in12"><field name="NUM">0</field></shadow></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="is13"><field name="VAR" id="aiVar13">ai market dwell</field><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="in13"><field name="NUM">15</field></shadow></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="is14"><field name="VAR" id="aiVar14">ai market floor</field><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="in14"><field name="NUM">20</field></shadow></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="is15"><field name="VAR" id="aiVar15">ai entry gap</field><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="in15"><field name="NUM">2</field></shadow></value><next><block type="notify" id="in900"><field name="NOTIFICATION_TYPE">success</field><field name="NOTIFICATION_SOUND">silent</field><value name="MESSAGE"><block type="text" id="it900"><field name="TEXT">AI Vision Over/Under armed — reading every volatility market and opening a position at most every 2 s. Tuning is in the Run once at start block.</field></block></value></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block>
    </statement>
    <statement name="SUBMARKET">
      <block type="trade_definition_tradeoptions" id="aiOptions01">
        <mutation has_first_barrier="false" has_second_barrier="false" has_prediction="true"></mutation>
        <field name="DURATIONTYPE_LIST">t</field>
        <field name="CURRENCY_LIST">USD</field>
        <value name="DURATION"><block type="variables_get" id="g027"><field name="VAR" id="aiVar02">ai duration</field></block></value>
        <value name="AMOUNT">
          <block type="r_safe_stake" id="aiSafe01">
            <value name="STAKE">
              <block type="vision_stake" id="aiStake01">
                <value name="BASE"><block type="variables_get" id="g028"><field name="VAR" id="aiVar01">ai base stake</field></block></value>
              </block>
            </value>
            <value name="PERCENT"><block type="variables_get" id="g029"><field name="VAR" id="aiVar11">ai stake percent</field></block></value>
          </block>
        </value>
        <value name="PREDICTION">
          <block type="vision_barrier" id="aiBarrier01"></block>
        </value>
        <field name="AMOUNT_LIMITS"></field>
      </block>
    </statement>
  </block>
  <block type="tick_analysis" id="aiTick01" x="0" y="1500">
    <statement name="TICKANALYSIS_STACK">
      <block type="vision_auto_market" id="aiMarketPick01">
        <field name="MODE">suitable</field>
        <value name="FLOOR"><block type="variables_get" id="amg01"><field name="VAR" id="aiVar14">ai market floor</field></block></value>
        <value name="DWELL"><block type="variables_get" id="amg02"><field name="VAR" id="aiVar13">ai market dwell</field></block></value>
        <next>
          <block type="vision_analyse" id="aiAnalyse01">
            <value name="HORIZON"><block type="variables_get" id="g050"><field name="VAR" id="aiVar02">ai duration</field></block></value>
            <value name="MIN_EDGE"><block type="variables_get" id="g051"><field name="VAR" id="aiVar03">ai min edge</field></block></value>
            <value name="MIN_LEAN"><block type="variables_get" id="g052"><field name="VAR" id="aiVar04">ai min lean</field></block></value>
            <value name="MIN_CONFIDENCE"><block type="variables_get" id="g053"><field name="VAR" id="aiVar05">ai min confidence</field></block></value>
            <value name="AGREEMENT"><block type="variables_get" id="g054"><field name="VAR" id="aiVar06">ai agreement</field></block></value>
            <value name="RISK"><block type="variables_get" id="g055"><field name="VAR" id="aiVar07">ai risk</field></block></value>
          </block>
        </next>
      </block>
    </statement>
  </block>
  <block type="before_purchase" id="aiBefore01" x="0" y="760">
    <statement name="BEFOREPURCHASE_STACK">
      <block type="controls_if" id="aiEntryIf01">
        <value name="IF0"><block type="logic_operation" id="l038"><field name="OP">AND</field>
          <value name="A"><block type="logic_operation" id="l039"><field name="OP">AND</field>
            <value name="A"><block type="vision_go" id="aiGo01"></block></value>
            <value name="B"><block type="vision_entry_ready" id="aiPace01"><value name="GAP"><block type="variables_get" id="g036"><field name="VAR" id="aiVar15">ai entry gap</field></block></value></block></value>
          </block></value>
          <value name="B"><block type="logic_operation" id="l037"><field name="OP">AND</field>
            <value name="A"><block type="r_loss_guard" id="r030"><value name="LIMIT"><block type="variables_get" id="g031"><field name="VAR" id="aiVar08">ai loss limit</field></block></value></block></value>
            <value name="B"><block type="r_profit_guard" id="r032"><value name="TARGET"><block type="variables_get" id="g033"><field name="VAR" id="aiVar09">ai profit target</field></block></value></block></value>
          </block></value>
        </block></value>
        <statement name="DO0">
          <block type="variables_set" id="s049"><field name="VAR" id="aiVar12">ai contracts</field>
            <value name="VALUE"><block type="math_arithmetic" id="m046"><field name="OP">ADD</field>
              <value name="A"><block type="variables_get" id="g047"><field name="VAR" id="aiVar12">ai contracts</field></block></value>
              <value name="B"><shadow type="math_number" id="n048"><field name="NUM">1</field></shadow></value>
            </block></value>
            <next>
              <block type="vision_mark_entry" id="aiMark01">
                <next>
                  <block type="controls_if" id="aiDirIf01">
                    <mutation else="1"></mutation>
                    <value name="IF0">
                      <block type="logic_compare" id="aiCmp01">
                        <field name="OP">EQ</field>
                        <value name="A"><block type="vision_direction" id="aiDir01"></block></value>
                        <value name="B"><block type="text" id="t045"><field name="TEXT">over</field></block></value>
                      </block>
                    </value>
                    <statement name="DO0">
                      <block type="notify" id="no039"><field name="NOTIFICATION_TYPE">success</field><field name="NOTIFICATION_SOUND">silent</field>
                        <value name="MESSAGE"><block type="vision_summary" id="vs040"></block></value>
                        <next><block type="purchase" id="pu041"><field name="PURCHASE_LIST">DIGITOVER</field></block></next>
                      </block>
                    </statement>
                    <statement name="ELSE">
                      <block type="notify" id="no042"><field name="NOTIFICATION_TYPE">info</field><field name="NOTIFICATION_SOUND">silent</field>
                        <value name="MESSAGE"><block type="vision_summary" id="vs043"></block></value>
                        <next><block type="purchase" id="pu044"><field name="PURCHASE_LIST">DIGITUNDER</field></block></next>
                      </block>
                    </statement>
                  </block>
                </next>
              </block>
            </next>
          </block>
        </statement>
      </block>
    </statement>
  </block>
  <block type="after_purchase" id="aiAfter01" x="760" y="760">
    <statement name="AFTERPURCHASE_STACK">
      <block type="vision_learn" id="aiLearn01">
        <value name="DIGIT"><shadow type="math_number" id="n056"><field name="NUM">-1</field></shadow></value>
        <next>
          <block type="controls_if" id="aiAgainIf01">
            <mutation else="1"></mutation>
            <value name="IF0"><block type="logic_operation" id="l063"><field name="OP">AND</field>
              <value name="A"><block type="r_loss_guard" id="r059"><value name="LIMIT"><block type="variables_get" id="g060"><field name="VAR" id="aiVar08">ai loss limit</field></block></value></block></value>
              <value name="B"><block type="r_profit_guard" id="r061"><value name="TARGET"><block type="variables_get" id="g062"><field name="VAR" id="aiVar09">ai profit target</field></block></value></block></value>
            </block></value>
            <statement name="DO0">
              <block type="vision_wait_entry" id="aiPace02">
                <value name="GAP"><block type="variables_get" id="g037"><field name="VAR" id="aiVar15">ai entry gap</field></block></value>
                <next><block type="trade_again" id="ta064"></block></next>
              </block>
            </statement>
            <statement name="ELSE">
              <block type="notify" id="no057">
                <field name="NOTIFICATION_TYPE">warn</field>
                <field name="NOTIFICATION_SOUND">silent</field>
                <value name="MESSAGE"><block type="text" id="t058"><field name="TEXT">AI Vision stopped — profit target or loss limit reached. Open contracts still settle.</field></block></value>
              </block>
            </statement>
          </block>
        </next>
      </block>
    </statement>
  </block>
  <block type="during_purchase" id="aiDuring01" x="1520" y="0">
    <statement name="DURING_PURCHASE_STACK"></statement>
  </block>
</xml>
